
[l_english.FOCUS_C12_PEACEFUL_ISOLATION]
Peaceful Isolation

[l_english.FOCUS_C12_PEACEFUL_ISOLATION_desc]
The Pie family still has an old debt unsettled with the Empire.\nYet, for the sake of every pony who works the farmlands, we cannot let wrath blind our judgment, nor lead them to perish in the flames of vengeance.\nOnly by staying true to our purpose and nurturing prosperity can we build a haven of peace for our ponies amidst the chaos that looms ahead.

[l_simp_chinese.FOCUS_C12_PEACEFUL_ISOLATION]
和平孤立

[l_simp_chinese.FOCUS_C12_PEACEFUL_ISOLATION_desc]
派家族与帝国之间，还有一笔尚未清算的旧账。\n然而，念及所有农场上小马们的未来，我们不能被怒火蒙蔽双眼，更不能带着他们一同葬身于复仇的烈焰。\n唯有坚守初心，振兴经济，方能在这即将到来的乱世之中为劳苦的小马们筑起一处安宁的避风港。
